{"seq":1,"slug":"mobile-performance","title":"移动性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/mobile-game-development/performance/mobile-performance","wordCount":1711,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"移动性能优化\">移动性能优化</h1><p>移动性能优化的第一性原理只有一句话：一帧的时间是固定的，你只能在里面塞下能塞下的东西。60 帧意味着每帧 16.7 毫秒，120 帧则只剩 8.3 毫秒——这个数字是物理的、不可谈判的，所有优化工作都是围绕它展开的分配游戏。更残酷的是，手机还会因为发热在玩了几分钟后偷偷把你的预算砍掉一半。本篇从帧预算这个统一标尺出发，讲清 CPU/GPU 瓶颈定位、热降频、以及如何用 profiler 找到真正该优化的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>性能优化的核心是「帧预算」（frame budget）：目标帧率倒数就是每帧的总时间预算，CPU 和 GPU 必须各自在这个预算内完成工作，且两者是并行流水线的关系。哪一边超时，哪一边就是瓶颈。优化的全部艺术，是先定位瓶颈在 CPU 还是 GPU，再把超时的那一侧压回预算内。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[目标帧率] --&gt; B[每帧预算&lt;br/&gt;16.7ms 或 8.3ms]&#10;    B --&gt; C[CPU 侧]&#10;    B --&gt; D[GPU 侧]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[游戏逻辑/物理/AI]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[Draw call 提交]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[脚本/GC]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[顶点处理]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[像素/片元着色]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[后处理]&#10;    C --&gt; E{谁超时?}&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt;|CPU 瓶颈| F[降逻辑/合批/多线程]&#10;    E --&gt;|GPU 瓶颈| G[降画质/降分辨率]\">flowchart TD\n    A[目标帧率] --&gt; B[每帧预算&lt;br/&gt;16.7ms 或 8.3ms]\n    B --&gt; C[CPU 侧]\n    B --&gt; D[GPU 侧]\n    C --&gt; C1[游戏逻辑/物理/AI]\n    C --&gt; C2[Draw call 提交]\n    C --&gt; C3[脚本/GC]\n    D --&gt; D1[顶点处理]\n    D --&gt; D2[像素/片元着色]\n    D --&gt; D3[后处理]\n    C --&gt; E{谁超时?}\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt;|CPU 瓶颈| F[降逻辑/合批/多线程]\n    E --&gt;|GPU 瓶颈| G[降画质/降分辨率]</pre><p>帧预算可以精确量化。对目标帧率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，每帧总预算为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1000</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac><mtext> ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{frame} = \\frac{1000}{f}\\ \\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">am</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>CPU 与 GPU 并行，因此实际帧时间约等于两者中较慢的一个加上同步开销：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{actual} \\approx \\max(T_{cpu}, T_{gpu}) + T_{sync}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">sy</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{actual} &gt; T_{frame}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">am</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，帧率就掉。下表是常见目标的预算分解参考：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标帧率</th>\n<th>每帧总预算</th>\n<th>典型 CPU 分配</th>\n<th>典型 GPU 分配</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>30 fps</td>\n<td>33.3 ms</td>\n<td>较宽松</td>\n<td>较宽松</td>\n<td>低端机、重画面策略游戏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>60 fps</td>\n<td>16.7 ms</td>\n<td>~8–10 ms</td>\n<td>~8–10 ms</td>\n<td>主流目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>90 fps</td>\n<td>11.1 ms</td>\n<td>~5–6 ms</td>\n<td>~5–6 ms</td>\n<td>高刷竞技</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>120 fps</td>\n<td>8.3 ms</td>\n<td>~4 ms</td>\n<td>~4 ms</td>\n<td>旗舰高刷、电竞手游</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cpu-瓶颈-逻辑-合批与多线程\">CPU 瓶颈：逻辑、合批与多线程</h2><p>当 profiler 显示 CPU 帧时间超标而 GPU 还有富余时，瓶颈在 CPU。移动 CPU 的常见杀手有三类。第一是游戏逻辑、物理和 AI 的计算量，尤其是每帧遍历大量实体的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 甚至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 循环——空间分区、对象池、按需更新（不是每个对象每帧都跑完整逻辑）是常规解法。第二是 Draw call 提交开销：每次 draw call 都有 CPU 端的状态切换成本，过多的 draw call 会让 CPU 忙于「指挥」而非「计算」，合批（batching）是关键手段，这一侧的细节在<a href=\"graphics-optimization\">图形与渲染优化</a>里深入。第三是脚本语言开销与垃圾回收停顿，后者在<a href=\"memory-battery\">内存与电量管理</a>中专门讨论。</p>\n<p>移动设备普遍是大小核异构架构（big.LITTLE）。把重负载固定到大核能提性能但更耗电更发热，分散到小核则省电但慢。现代引擎用作业系统（Job System）+ ECS 把可并行的工作（物理、剔除、动画）拆成任务分发到多核，但要小心：核间同步和数据竞争的处理不当，多线程反而更慢。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gpu-瓶颈-填充率与带宽\">GPU 瓶颈：填充率与带宽</h2><p>当 GPU 帧时间超标时，问题通常出在两件事：填充率（fill rate）和内存带宽。移动 GPU 多采用 TBDR（基于瓦片的延迟渲染）架构，把屏幕切成小瓦片逐块渲染以节省带宽，这与桌面 GPU 的即时渲染有本质差异，优化策略也不同。</p>\n<p>GPU 侧最常见的浪费是 overdraw——同一个像素被反复绘制多次（半透明叠加、UI 层叠、粒子堆积是重灾区）。分辨率是 GPU 负载的平方级放大器：渲染分辨率从 1080p 降到 720p，像素着色工作量直接减少约 55%，这是低端机最立竿见影的优化杠杆。具体的 overdraw、着色器复杂度、纹理带宽优化手段，全部归在<a href=\"graphics-optimization\">图形与渲染优化</a>里展开，本篇只确立「GPU 瓶颈 → 优先动分辨率和后处理」这条决策原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"热降频-被偷走的预算\">热降频：被偷走的预算</h2><p>移动性能最反直觉的一点是：你的设备性能不是恒定的。手机没有主动散热，长时间高负载会让 SoC 温度升高，系统为了保护硬件会触发热降频（thermal throttling），逐步降低 CPU/GPU 频率。结果是游戏开局 60 帧流畅，玩五到十分钟后悄悄掉到 40 帧甚至更低——这是评测和短时间测试根本发现不了的陷阱。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[持续高负载] --&gt; B[SoC 温度上升]&#10;    B --&gt; C{超过温度阈值?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[系统降频]&#10;    D --&gt; E[帧率下降]&#10;    E --&gt; F[玩家体验恶化]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| G[维持性能]&#10;    D --&gt; H[应对: 主动限帧/降画质]&#10;    H --&gt; I[温度回落]&#10;    I --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[持续高负载] --&gt; B[SoC 温度上升]\n    B --&gt; C{超过温度阈值?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[系统降频]\n    D --&gt; E[帧率下降]\n    E --&gt; F[玩家体验恶化]\n    C --&gt;|否| G[维持性能]\n    D --&gt; H[应对: 主动限帧/降画质]\n    H --&gt; I[温度回落]\n    I --&gt; G</pre><p>应对热降频的核心思路是「主动留出余量」而非「榨干性能」。具体做法包括：不盲目追求最高帧率，在画面够用时主动锁 30 或 60 帧给热量留缓冲；监测设备热状态（iOS 的 thermalState、Android 的 thermal API），在升温时动态降低画质或帧率；以及把这种「可降级」能力做成<a href=\"../foundations/mobile-platforms\">移动平台与生态</a>里提到的设备分层机制的一部分。一个设计良好的游戏，应该能在持续游玩下维持稳定而非峰值的性能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"profiling-先测量-再优化\">Profiling：先测量，再优化</h2><p>性能优化最大的错误是凭感觉优化。「我觉得这里慢」往往是错的——真正的热点常藏在意想不到的地方。纪律是：永远先用 profiler 测量，定位真实瓶颈，再动手。主流工具链包括 Unity Profiler、Unreal 的 Unreal Insights、以及平台原生工具 Xcode Instruments（含 Metal System Trace）和 Android GPU Inspector / Perfetto。</p>\n<p>profiling 要回答的核心问题是：这一帧的时间花在了哪里、瓶颈在 CPU 还是 GPU、是逻辑慢还是渲染慢、有没有 GC 尖峰。一个实用流程是：先看帧时间是否稳定，再看 CPU/GPU 哪个占满，然后下钻到具体函数或渲染阶段，最后针对性优化并回测验证。切记优化要量化——「优化后从 12ms 降到 8ms」才是结论，「感觉快了点」不是。这条「测量—定位—优化—回测」的闭环，同样适用于后面<a href=\"../release-ops/analytics-liveops\">数据与运营</a>里的线上性能监控，只是把单机 profiler 换成了海量真机的遥测数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>帧预算是一切优化的统一标尺：60 fps = 16.7ms/帧，120 fps = 8.3ms/帧，CPU 与 GPU 并行，谁超时谁是瓶颈。</li>\n<li>CPU 瓶颈的三大杀手是逻辑计算量、draw call 提交、脚本与 GC；用空间分区、合批、Job System 多线程应对。</li>\n<li>GPU 瓶颈集中在填充率与带宽，降分辨率是平方级杠杆；具体渲染手段归入图形优化篇。</li>\n<li>热降频会在数分钟后悄悄砍半性能，必须主动限帧、监测热状态、动态降级，而非榨干峰值。</li>\n<li>永远先 profiling 再优化，用平台工具定位真实瓶颈，并以量化数字验证优化效果。</li>\n<li>「测量—定位—优化—回测」的闭环从单机 profiler 一直延伸到线上遥测监控。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"移动性能优化","id":"移动性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CPU 瓶颈：逻辑、合批与多线程","id":"cpu-瓶颈-逻辑-合批与多线程"},{"level":2,"text":"GPU 瓶颈：填充率与带宽","id":"gpu-瓶颈-填充率与带宽"},{"level":2,"text":"热降频：被偷走的预算","id":"热降频-被偷走的预算"},{"level":2,"text":"Profiling：先测量，再优化","id":"profiling-先测量-再优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"触控与传感器输入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/mobile-game-development/foundations/input-touch"},"next":{"title":"内存与电量管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/mobile-game-development/performance/memory-battery"}}